### Title:
"LEARN MORE" button does not lead to About Us Page

### Environment:
- Browser: Google Chrome 120
- OS: Windows 10
- Version: Demo / Test

### Preconditions:
- User is not logged in

### Steps to Reproduce:
1. Open the application from the URL
2. Click on the "Learn More" button

### Expected Result:
- After clicking the "LEARN MORE" button, the user is redirected to the About Us Page.

### Actual Result:
- After clicking the "LEARN MORE" button, the page just scrolls and does not navigate.

